---
import site from '~/data/site.json';
---

<section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-cream-dark">
  <div class="max-w-content mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-5 gap-10 md:gap-14 items-center">
      <div class="md:col-span-2">
        <!-- Owner photo placeholder. Friend to send. -->
        <div class="aspect-[4/5] bg-gradient-to-br from-forest to-bark rounded-2xl shadow-soft flex items-center justify-center">
          <span class="text-cream/70 text-sm">[Owner photo coming]</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="md:col-span-3">
        <div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest2 text-bark mb-3">Owner-led, not a franchise</div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-3xl md:text-4xl text-forest leading-tight mb-6">Commercial arborist by training, working for you on evenings and weekends.</h2>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-ink leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            Tarzan Trimming is a side business run by an arborist who works on commercial crews during the day. Real rigging, real PPE, real cut technique, on real jobs.
          </p>
          <p>
            That same approach gets brought home on the weekend. Scaled down to a residential job and priced honestly for the customer who hires us directly, without the franchise markup or commission rep in the middle.
          </p>
          <p class="text-ink-muted text-sm">
            <em>For now, the focus is pruning and limb removal. Full tree removals are coming as the business grows. If you need something we cannot do safely, we will tell you and point you to a crew that can.</em>
          </p>
        </div>

        <a href="/about/" class="inline-block mt-7 text-forest font-medium hover:text-forest-dark transition-colors">
          Read more about how we work →
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
